Happy birthday, dear Gigi! Happy birthday to you!

332
00:38:22,224 --> 00:38:26,224
You live like this?

333
00:38:26,224 --> 00:38:30,224
Girl, you live like this? What is... I thought we were supposed to be having a party!

334
00:38:30,224 --> 00:38:35,224
This is how you invite guests! Leave me alone, it's my birthday!

335
00:38:35,224 --> 00:38:41,224
Wait, I'm late! There was like a... yeah, someone stole a stop sign and there was a car crash...

336
00:38:41,224 --> 00:38:48,224
What? Wait, wait, there's a stop sign? Did you... did you?

337
00:38:48,224 --> 00:38:52,224
Shi-chi? Shi-chi? We've always had that. I've had that for like 50 years!

338
00:38:52,224 --> 00:38:56,224
On the other street?

339
00:38:56,224 --> 00:39:04,224
Guys, guys! It's my birthday! And I make the rules, and my rule is that everyone has to do fan service for me.

340
00:39:04,224 --> 00:39:07,224
Fan service? I didn't hear about this.

341
00:39:07,224 --> 00:39:13,224
Well, you have to! Thanks for having us, Gigi! Okay, you start.

342
00:39:13,224 --> 00:39:16,224
Me? Fan service? Come on.

343
00:39:16,224 --> 00:39:22,224
Oh, well, when it comes to chu, I think I have the perfect gift for you.

344
00:39:22,224 --> 00:39:27,724
I'm just gonna go real low... Get in!

345
00:39:27,724 --> 00:39:32,224
Oh, she's dead! She's dead!

346
00:39:32,224 --> 00:39:37,224
My toes, they're wet!

347
00:39:37,224 --> 00:39:44,224
Wow. Okay, happy birthday! Happy birthday! Okay, I wish. Come on.

348
00:39:44,224 --> 00:39:49,224
Fan service? Easy, easy, easy. Put your head down a little bit.

349
00:39:49,224 --> 00:40:01,723
Whoa! Whoa! Ow! Ow! Ow! I'm starting, I'm starting!

350
00:41:17,695 --> 00:41:22,415
みんなー！チルノの算数教室、始まるよ！
Everyone! Cirno's Math Class is starting now!

351
00:41:22,555 --> 00:41:27,475
あたいみたいな天才目指して、頑張っていってね！
Aim to be a genius like me and do your best!

352
00:41:27,655 --> 00:41:30,295
キラキラダイヤモンド
Sparkling diamond,

353
00:41:30,455 --> 00:41:32,915
輝く星のように
Like a shining star,

354
00:41:33,095 --> 00:41:36,355
栄光 志望校なんとかして入ろう
Glory, let's somehow get into our dream school!

355
00:41:36,455 --> 00:41:38,995
天才秀才トップ目指して Go, go
Aim for the top as a genius or prodigy, Go, go!

356
00:41:39,275 --> 00:41:44,695
ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか
Baka baka baka baka baka baka baka baka!

357
00:41:44,855 --> 00:41:48,815
（ばかって言うほうがばかなのよ）
(The one calling others baka is the real baka!)

358
00:41:50,475 --> 00:41:56,175
ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか
Baka baka baka baka baka baka baka baka!

359
00:41:56,335 --> 00:42:00,275
（なにようるさいわね、このバカ！）
(What?! You're so annoying, you baka!)

360
00:42:00,835 --> 00:42:05,995
紅魔館からバスが出て 初めに三人乗りました
A bus left the Scarlet Devil Mansion and three people boarded first!

361
00:42:06,155 --> 00:42:11,515
白玉楼で一人降りて半人だけ乗りました
One person got off at Hakugokuro and half a person boarded!

362
00:42:11,795 --> 00:42:17,435
八雲さん家で二人降りて 結局乗客合計何人だ？
Two people got off at the Yakumo residence, so what's the total number of passengers?

363
00:42:17,655 --> 00:42:19,995
答えは答えは０人０人
The answer is 0 people, 0 people!

364
00:42:20,155 --> 00:42:22,515
なぜならなぜならそれは 幻想郷にバス無い
Because, you see, there are no buses in Gensokyo!

365
00:42:22,775 --> 00:42:28,055
ヤマオチ意味などないわ キャラクター立てばいいのよ
Punchlines and meaning don't matter as long as the characters stand out!

366
00:42:28,215 --> 00:42:31,775
元気があればなんでも １, ２, ９！
As long as you have energy, anything goes! 1, 2, 9!

367
00:42:31,935 --> 00:42:38,015
くるくる時計の針 ぐるぐる頭回る
The clock hands go round and round, my head spins round and round!

368
00:42:38,335 --> 00:42:46,815
だってつぶら目玉二つしかないのに 三本の針なんてちんぷんかん 次々問題出る まだまだ授業続く
Even though I only have two round eyeballs, three clock hands make no sense! Questions keep coming, class still continues!

369
00:42:47,095 --> 00:42:50,315
凍る部屋の中 ひんやりした温度も
Inside the freezing room, even the chilly temperature...

370
00:42:50,615 --> 00:42:54,875
時間も気にせず ゆっくりしていってね！
Without caring about time, take it easy and stay a while!

371
00:42:55,115 --> 00:43:01,075
ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか （だから、バカじゃないって言ってるでしょ）
Baka baka baka baka baka baka! (I'm telling you, I'm not a baka!)

372
00:43:01,355 --> 00:43:06,975
ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか （いい加減にしないと冷凍するわよ）
Baka baka baka baka baka baka! (If you don't shape up, I'll freeze you!)

373
00:43:07,275 --> 00:43:12,915
ばーかばーか ばーかばーか ばーかばーか （そして粉々になって死ねばいいのよ）
Baka baka baka baka baka baka! (You should just shatter into pieces and die!)

374
00:43:13,195 --> 00:43:18,875
ばーかばーか ばーかばーか 霊夢とこの百万円のつぼを誰かが割っちゃった
Baka baka baka baka! Someone broke Reimu's million-yen jar!

375
00:43:19,175 --> 00:43:23,535
永遠亭のえーりんが弁償しに来ましたよ
Eirin from Eientei came to compensate for it!

376
00:43:23,815 --> 00:43:29,255
知らんぷりのイタズラてゐ 結局賠償金額いくら？
Tei playing innocent with her pranks—how much is the final compensation amount?

377
00:43:29,575 --> 00:43:38,875
答えは 答えは ０円 ０円 なぜなら なぜなら それは そんなつぼあるわけない
The answer is 0 yen, 0 yen! Because, you see, there's no way a jar like that exists!

378
00:43:39,175 --> 00:43:45,015
常識超えたところに 世界の真理がある 秘密の数字目指して １, ２, ９！
Beyond common sense lies the truth of the world! Aiming for the secret numbers, 1, 2, 9!

379
00:43:45,275 --> 00:43:50,335
ヘラヘラにやけながら ゲラゲラ笑いながら
Smiling sheepishly while guffawing and laughing,

380
00:43:50,695 --> 00:43:56,175
うっさー 因幡うさぎ 可愛げもないのに 新参の厨なんてほいほいほい
How annoying, Inaba the rabbit, with zero cuteness, taking newcomer trolls hoi hoi hoi!

381
00:43:56,415 --> 00:44:02,335
再生百万回 もれなく愚民なんて どういうことなのよ
One million views with rabble included as a bonus—what is the meaning of this?

382
00:44:02,595 --> 00:44:08,415
どちらかって言うならサーバー管理も お疲れさんってとこね
If anything, "good job" on server management too!

383
00:44:08,655 --> 00:44:17,035
（わかった！アタイがあまりにも天才だから嫉妬してるんでしょ？）（ほんと、しょうがないわねぇせっかくだからアタイの天才の秘訣をちょっとだけ教えてあげてもいいわよ）
(I get it! You're jealous because I'm so much of a genius!) (Honestly, you're hopeless! Since we're at it, I might as well teach you a little secret to my genius.)

384
00:44:17,315 --> 00:44:23,815
あらゆる あらゆる あらゆる あらゆる あらゆる 英知を 集めて 集めて 集めて 集めて 束ねても
Gathering, gathering, gathering, gathering, gathering all kinds of wisdom, even if you bundle them together,

385
00:44:24,075 --> 00:44:33,915
あたいの あたいの あたいの あたいの あたいの 丈夫な 頭に 頭に 頭に 頭に かなわない
You still can't compare to my, my, my, my, my sturdy head, head, head, head!

386
00:44:34,155 --> 00:44:39,775
朝飯 朝飯 朝飯 朝飯 朝飯 食べたら 赤子の 赤子の 赤子の 赤子の 手をひねる
Once you eat breakfast, breakfast, breakfast, breakfast, breakfast, it's like twisting a baby's, baby's, baby's, baby's arm!

387
00:44:40,015 --> 00:44:45,275
あたいは あたいは あたいは あたいは あたいは 完璧 いわゆる いわゆる いわゆる いわゆる パーフェクト
I am, I am, I am, I am, I am perfect, so-called, so-called, so-called, so-called perfect!

388
00:44:45,535 --> 00:44:51,455
ひゃくおくちょうまんバッチリ！
Hundred-billion-trillion percent spot on!

389
00:44:51,455 --> 00:44:59,155
あたいは あたいは あたいは あたいは 天才 バリバリ バリバリ バリバリ バリ パーフェクト！
I am, I am, I am, I am a genius, baribari baribari baribari bari perfect!

390
00:46:14,493 --> 00:46:17,933
キミと 一緒がいちばん 好きよってもっとぎゅっとね キミを 新しい場所へと
Being together with you is the best! I love you so much, let's hold each other tighter. I'll pull you to a brand-new place

391
00:46:18,073 --> 00:46:21,633
引っぱってっちゃう る・らんら! 遅れないでね
and drag you along, ru-ran-ra! Don't fall behind!

392
00:46:23,173 --> 00:46:28,013
もっともっともっともっともっと よいしょ! もっともっともっともっともっと よいしょ!
More and more and more! Heave-ho! More and more and more! Heave-ho!

393
00:46:37,293 --> 00:46:41,933
飛んでけすごいな 誰が? 私たちですよ!
Fly away, how amazing! Who is it? Us, of course!

394
00:46:42,153 --> 00:46:45,593
線引きはないの いやっほ〜楽しい宴
There are no boundaries, yay~ a joyful banquet!

395
00:46:45,953 --> 00:46:49,713
ぜったい終わらない魔法かけて ドキドキの前夜祭
Cast an unbreakable magic spell for a thrilling eve!

396
00:46:49,873 --> 00:46:54,073
遊んで遊んでばかりがいいな でしょ? やっぱりやっぱりそうでしょ?
Playing all day long is the best, right? Isn't it definitely, definitely right?

397
00:46:57,433 --> 00:47:01,193
お祭りよいしょで仲良し なかよし
Festival heave-ho and good friends (good-friends)!

398
00:47:02,753 --> 00:47:06,673
君へのよいしょは自然体 あふぇくしょん
Cheering for you is totally natural (affection)!

399
00:47:08,013 --> 00:47:12,193
お出かけの順序は スイッチ入ってハイになって完了だ!
The order for going out: flip the switch, get high, and we're done!

400
00:47:12,973 --> 00:47:17,973
甘いデリカシーで ほんのりさっぱりあっさりぴったり恋しちゃう
With sweet delicacy, we fall lightly, cleanly, simply, and perfectly in love!

401
00:47:19,553 --> 00:47:23,093
キミと 一緒がいちばん 好きよってもっとぎゅっとね キミを 新しい場所へと
Being together with you is the best! I love you so much, let's hold each other tighter. I'll pull you to a brand-new place

402
00:47:23,513 --> 00:47:27,133
引っぱってっちゃう る・らんら! して?
and drag you along, ru-ran-ra! Won't you?

403
00:47:30,213 --> 00:47:34,313
ホント 一緒にいたいな 邪魔されたくないんだもん
Really, I want to be together with you! I don't want anyone getting in our way.

404
00:47:37,053 --> 00:47:41,013
キミに 秘密の場所では 張りきっちゃうよ る・らんら? る・らんら! だよ
In our secret spot with you, I'll go all out! Ru-ran-ra? Ru-ran-ra, you see!

405
00:47:51,433 --> 00:47:55,013
ポイ捨てしないで 誰の? 君たちの拍手! 大切な合図
Don't litter! Whose? Your applause! Our precious signal!

406
00:47:58,913 --> 00:48:03,093
いやっふ〜嬉しい集い 断然おもしろい筈だから
Yay~ a joyful gathering! Because it's definitely going to be interesting,

407
00:48:04,553 --> 00:48:08,853
ズキズキの感謝祭 廻って廻ってみせてよほらね
A throbbing thanksgiving festival! Spin and spin around for me, see?

408
00:48:09,693 --> 00:48:14,213
すごい? やっぱりやっぱり、ね! すごい! 過激なわっしょいでぱわふる
Amazing? As expected, right! Amazing! With extreme festival energy, so powerful!

409
00:48:17,393 --> 00:48:21,653
私もわっしょいで保健体育
I'll join the festival too with health and physical education!

410
00:48:22,973 --> 00:48:27,553
お休みのコールは スリーとツーとワンでもって完成だ!
The bedtime call is complete with three, two, and one!

411
00:48:30,273 --> 00:48:34,613
ゆるいテレパシーが やんわりそっくりおっとりぷっくり恋なの
Gentle telepathy is softly, precisely, gently, and roundly falling in love!

412
00:48:35,973 --> 00:48:40,153
あのね 応援させてよ いつだってやっぱ元気に
You know, let me cheer for you! Always energetic as ever,

413
00:48:40,453 --> 00:48:44,793
あのさ 踊りたいこのとき 置いてっちゃって じ・だんだ! ふむ?
You see, I want to dance right now! Leaving you behind, stomping our feet! Hmm?

414
00:48:45,113 --> 00:48:49,453
ホンキ 応援したいな 落ち込みたくないんだもん
Seriously, I want to cheer you on! Because I don't want to feel down.

415
00:48:49,713 --> 00:48:55,273
あのね 冒険夢みて 知らないフリ じ・だんだ? じ・だんだ! だね
You know, dreaming of adventures, playing dumb, stomping our feet, right?

416
00:49:05,193 --> 00:49:09,113
キミと 一緒がいちばん 好きよってもっとぎゅっとね キミを
Being together with you is what I love most! But I want to hold you even tighter...

417
00:49:11,333 --> 00:49:15,233
新しい場所へと 引っぱってっちゃう る・らんら! して?
...and drag you along to a brand-new place, ru-ran-ra! Won't you?

418
00:49:16,833 --> 00:49:20,693
ホント 一緒にいたいな 邪魔されたくないんだもん
Really, I want to stay with you! I don't want anyone getting in our way.

419
00:49:21,653 --> 00:49:26,153
キミに 秘密の場所では 張りきっちゃうよ る・らんら? る・らんら! だよ
In our secret spot with you, I'll go all out! Ru-ran-ra? Ru-ran-ra, you see!

420
00:49:51,954 --> 00:49:56,614
Bye guys! Thanks for coming! Yay!

421
00:49:57,434 --> 00:50:00,094
I wanted to show off...

422
00:50:02,396 --> 00:50:09,556
Everyone, get out your wallets because it is time. You know what time it is? It's merch time! Check it out!

423
00:50:10,913 --> 00:50:16,053
Ooh, so many acrylic stands! Are you able to tell who is Gigi Murin?

424
00:50:16,393 --> 00:50:20,943
[Sign: STOP] You couldn't tell? You weren't able to tell? Well, I have great news for merch buyers for Gigi Murin's birthday.

425
00:50:29,883 --> 00:50:32,153
Check this out! Number one!

426
