[Title: Onaka Peko Peko Bowl] We have a nice yummy bowl that you can eat out of. Look at that! I call this the Onaka Peko Peko bowl because you are just a hungry hungry gremlin. And you can use it while you eat cereal, or rice, or anything! Just put anything you want in the bowl and you can eat out of it.

429
00:51:24,267 --> 00:51:30,787
Not an acrylic stand? Well, I still have more merch! Check out the next one!

430
00:51:31,500 --> 00:51:58,160
[Title: Squeaky Plushie Keychain Playful Outfit ver.] It's a plushie! It is a squeaky toy plushie in the tail. What does it look-- what? It looks similar to something? Yes. It is similar to my first birthday merch of, you know, the coveted Gigi Murin's squeaky toy plushie, but this time in my new outfit!

431
00:51:58,520 --> 00:52:10,380
And there's one more? There's one more? Oh my god. This one has to be an acrylic stand. Drumroll please! Next!

432
