[Title: Squishy Grem Squeeze Toy] It is not an acrylic stand. We have a squishy Grem squeeze toy instead. It is a little Grem, but it looks like a little bunny-- a yummy little grem inside of a plastic bag, and you can squish it and it should be really really squishy. If you need something for anti-stressing, I think it will be really cute on your bag, too. Are you imagining it? Are you imagining it? I'm squeezing it. I'm squeezing that grem.

433
00:52:36,987 --> 00:52:43,187
Yep, sorry to disappoint everyone. There is no acrylic stand in this merch set.

434
00:52:44,727 --> 00:52:48,867
But if you buy the full set purchase, bonus! Next over here!

435
00:52:49,607 --> 00:53:22,527
[Title: Set Purchase Bonus] You get a really really cute cheki by Ninomae Ina'nis, signed by me! It is so cute. So if you want the limited quantity autograph-- autograph over here, Ninomae Ina'nis's, signed by Gigi Murin, you're going to have to check the link in chat or in description. Many channels will be updating, and then you will see the when it goes for sale.

436
00:53:23,087 --> 00:53:37,437
And it also comes with a voice set. It is just an extra little bonus where I talk to you. There's not much I say, but I bet you're really really curious what I say and...

437
00:55:28,729 --> 00:55:33,729
Are you excited? Are you as excited as I am?

438
00:56:01,729 --> 00:56:04,229
Shunrai!

439
00:56:36,539 --> 00:56:40,379
現れたそれは春の真っ最中 えも言えぬまま輝いていた
Appearing right in the middle of spring, it was shining, unable to be put into words.

440
00:56:40,379 --> 00:56:43,639
どんな言葉も どんな手振りも足りやしないみたいんだ
It seemed like no words or gestures would ever be enough.

441
00:56:44,079 --> 00:56:47,979
その日から僕の胸には嵐が 住み着いたまま離れないんだ
Ever since that day, a storm has taken up residence in my chest and won't leave.

442
00:56:47,979 --> 00:56:51,439
人の声を借りた 蒼い眼の落雷だ
It was a blue-eyed lightning strike that borrowed a human voice.

443
00:56:51,439 --> 00:56:55,639
揺れながら踊るその髪の黒が 他のどれより嫋やかでした
The black of that hair dancing as it swayed was more graceful than anything else.

444
00:56:55,639 --> 00:56:59,329
すっと消えそうな 真っ白い肌によく似合ってました
It suited your pure white skin, which looked as though it might vanish at any moment.

445
00:56:59,779 --> 00:57:03,339
あなたにはこの世界の彩りが どう見えるのか知りたくて今
Wanting to know right now how the colors of this world look to you,

446
00:57:03,339 --> 00:57:07,179
頬に手を伸ばした 壊れそうでただ怖かった
I reached out my hand to your cheek; I was simply terrified it might break.

447
00:57:07,279 --> 00:57:10,979
全てはあなたの思い通り 悲しくって散らばった思いも全て
Everything is just as you desired; even all those sad, scattered thoughts

448
00:57:10,979 --> 00:57:15,019
あなたがくれたプレゼント ゆらゆら吹かれて深い惑い
Are presents you gave me, blown gently about by deep confusion

449
00:57:15,019 --> 00:57:18,779
痛み 憂い 恋しい
Pain, sorrow, and yearning.

450
00:57:23,079 --> 00:57:30,179
言葉にするのも 形にするのも そのどれもが覚束なくって
Whether putting it into words or giving it shape, none of it came easily,

451
00:57:30,179 --> 00:57:35,679
ただ目を見つめた するとあなたはふっと優しく笑ったんだ
So I simply gazed into your eyes, and then you gave a gentle, fleeting smile.

452
00:57:38,539 --> 00:57:42,519
嗄れた心も さざめく秘密も 気がつけば粉々になって
My hoarse heart and rustling secrets, before I knew it, had shattered into pieces,

453
00:57:42,519 --> 00:57:48,119
刹那の間に 痛みに似た恋が体を走ったんだ
And in the span of a fleeting moment, a love resembling pain raced through my body.

454
00:57:48,119 --> 00:57:53,239
深い惑い痛み憂い繰り返し いつの間にか春になった
Repeating deep confusion, pain, and sorrow, before I knew it, spring had arrived.

455
00:58:09,379 --> 00:58:13,379
甘い香り残し陰り恋焦がし 深く深く迷い込んだ
Leaving a sweet scent behind, yearning and burning with love, I wandered deep, deep inside.

456
00:58:13,379 --> 00:58:16,479
花びらが散ればあなたとおさらば それなら僕と踊りませんか
If the petals scatter and I bid you farewell, then won't you dance with me?

457
00:58:16,639 --> 00:58:20,779
宙を舞う花がどうもあなたみたいで参りました
The flowers dancing through the air look just like you, and I am completely won over.

458
00:58:20,779 --> 00:58:24,379
やがてまた巡りくる春の最中 そこは豊かなひだまりでした
Before long, in the middle of the returning spring, it was a rich, sunny spot.

459
00:58:24,639 --> 00:58:28,439
身をやつしてやまない あんな嵐はどこへやら
Where on earth did that ceaseless storm that exhausted us go?

460
00:58:28,439 --> 00:58:32,179
まだまだ心は帰れない
My heart still cannot return home.

461
00:58:32,579 --> 00:58:36,639
その細い声でどうか騙しておくれ カラカラに枯れ果てるまで
Please deceive me with that soft voice until I am completely dried up and withered.

462
00:58:36,639 --> 00:58:40,639
ふらふら揺れて甘い香り 残し 陰り 幻
Swaying unsteadily, leaving a sweet scent, a shadow, an illusion.

463
00:58:40,639 --> 00:58:44,479
聞きたい言葉も 言いたい想いも 笑うくらい山ほどあって
There are things I want to hear and feelings I want to express, enough to make you laugh.

464
00:58:44,479 --> 00:58:48,579
それでもあなたを前にすると 何にも出てはこないなんて
Yet whenever I am before you, nothing at all comes out.

465
00:58:48,579 --> 00:58:52,379
焦げ付く痛みも 刺し込む痺れも 口をつぐんだ恋とわかって
Knowing that the burning pain and piercing numbness are a love that sealed my lips,

466
00:58:52,379 --> 00:58:56,339
あなたの心に 橋をかける大事な雷雨だと知ったんだ
I realized it was an important thunderstorm building a bridge to your heart.

467
00:58:56,479 --> 00:58:59,679
どうか騙しておくれ 「愛」と笑っておくれ
Please deceive me, smile and call it 'love'.

468
00:58:59,679 --> 00:59:03,879
いつか消える日まで そのままでいて
Stay just as you are until the day we fade away.

469
00:59:03,879 --> 00:59:10,739
どうか騙しておくれ 「愛」と笑っておくれ
Please deceive me, smile and call it 'love'.

470
00:59:11,239 --> 00:59:15,339
いつか消える日まで そのままでいて
Stay just as you are until the day we fade away.

471
00:59:15,339 --> 00:59:19,039
言葉にするのも 形にするのも そのどれもが覚束なくって
Whether putting it into words or giving it shape, none of it came easily,

472
00:59:19,039 --> 00:59:25,539
ただ目を見つめた するとあなたはふっと優しく笑ったんだ
So I simply gazed into your eyes, and then you gave a gentle, fleeting smile.

473
00:59:42,379 --> 00:59:48,479
嗄れた心も さざめく秘密も 気がつけば粉々になって
My hoarse heart and rustling secrets, before I knew it, had shattered into pieces,

474
00:59:48,479 --> 01:00:01,179
刹那の間に 痛みに似た恋が体を走ったんだ
And in the span of a fleeting moment, a love resembling pain raced through my body.

475
01:00:01,620 --> 01:00:06,500
どうか騙しておくれ 「愛」と笑っておくれ
Please deceive me and smile, saying "Love"...

476
01:00:06,820 --> 01:00:09,470
いつか消える日まで そのままでいて
Stay just like that until the day you disappear.

477
01:00:09,650 --> 01:00:12,550
どうか騙しておくれ
Please deceive me...

478
01:00:13,200 --> 01:00:19,800
言葉にするのも 形にするのも そのどれもが覚束なくって
Putting it into words, shaping it into form... none of them came easily.

479
01:00:20,800 --> 01:00:27,850
ただ目を見つめた するとあなたはふっと優しく笑ったんだ
I simply gazed into your eyes, and you softly smiled.

480
01:00:28,950 --> 01:00:35,550
嗄れた心も さざめく秘密も 気がつけば粉々になって
A frayed heart and murmuring secrets—before I knew it, they shattered into pieces.

481
01:00:36,250 --> 01:00:43,150
刹那の間に 痛みに似た恋が体を走ったんだ
In an instant, a love akin to pain raced through my body.

482
01:01:09,350 --> 01:02:21,621
[Title: GIGI ROOM PARTY! GIGI MURIN BIRTHDAY HOUSE PARTY]

